/* Deploy EntryPoint validation simulation contracts (see voltaire-sim-deployer).
   Deployed through the deterministic factory with the salt
   keccak256("voltaire.entrypoint.simulations.v1"); the deploy data below is
   salt ++ initCode, where initCode is a 10-byte RETURN-the-runtime stub
   followed by the runtime bytecode from voltaire_bundler/contracts/<name>.json.
   The resulting on-chain code is byte-identical to the bundler's state-override
   bytecode, so check_deployed_simulations() finds these at boot and validation
   switches to a tiny delegatecall override instead of the full ~17KB one. */

